            "kind": "site",
            "summary": "A glass workshop in Istravel with a small repair room and a collection of clearly labelled failed experiments. Most of its business is ordinary glass. Its modest enchanted vessels require careful handling, compatible materials, and occasional renewal by someone who understands their particular binding.",
